### Admin posts notice for ALL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "title": "Mid-term exams from 20 Nov",
  "content": "Mid-term exams will start from 20 November. Check the timetable on the notice board.",
  "audience": "ALL"
}

### Faculty posts notice for STUDENT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{facultyToken}}

{
  "title": "DBMS assignment",
  "content": "Submit the ER diagram assignment by Friday.",
  "audience": "STUDENT"
}

